# Creative & projects

## Creative page (`creative.md`)

- Section order unless user says otherwise: **Film** → **Poetry** (cards) → **Zines** (cards).
- Film entries: title, role, place/period, photo grid (`film-photo-grid`), synopsis/process, script link.
- Poetry/Zines use the same card pattern: `creative-list` + `creative-item` (title, description, `zine-meta` for year • category, link `Open work (PDF)`).
- Section headings: use `<h2>` inside `.creative-page` (Markdown `##` inside a wrapping `<div>` can fail to render).
- Styles for Creative live in `assets/main.scss` (not a separate `creative.css` include).
- PDF/script links: `{{ item.file | relative_url }}` or `{{ film.script | relative_url }}`, `target="_blank" rel="noopener"`.
- Do not restore full-viewport horizontal zine carousels unless the user explicitly requests them.

## Data files (`_data/`)

- Quote YAML values containing `:` (e.g. project names like `Juxta: ...`).
- Creative schema example:
  - `zines`: `title`, `description`, `pdf`, `category`, `year`
  - `poems`: `title`, `description`, `file`, `category`, `year`
- Projects schema: `name`, `role`, `period`, `brief`, `highlights` (list), `tags`, `paper`.

## Projects & home

- `projects.md`: Research index grouped by `theme`; cards link to `/research/<slug>/`.
- `index.html`: short hero (`profile.hero` + CTA to About), photo; full background on `about.md`.
- Case study fields in `_data/projects.yml`: `motivation`, `contribution`, `insight`, `reflection`, `theme`, `flagship`, `slug`.
